  "figshare_url": "https://springernature.figshare.com/articles/dataset/A_Fully_Annotated_Pathology_Slide_Dataset_for_Early_Gastric_Cancer_and_Precancerous_Lesions/28919840",
  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "We present a comprehensive dataset comprising 104 whole-slide images with 308 tissue strips, all derived from endoscopic submucosal dissection (ESD) specimens. This collection includes not only the most common differentiated adenocarcinomas but also precancerous lesions, providing a valuable resource for research on early gastric cancer and its precursors.",
